      "type": "game",
      "name": "夜弦之音 - Echoes of Nocturnal Chords",
      "steam_appid": 1264350,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<h1>Game Information</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Echoes of Nocturnal Chords</i></strong> is the second full-length horror puzzle RPG created by the author of <strong><i>Feather Of Praying</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game continues the world view of the previous work, focusing on atmospheric immersion and narrative experience, making it suitable for players who enjoy immersive stories and light puzzles.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/b96cc742e2758fc888fa6b9dfd43a26a.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When all darkness fades away</strong><br><strong>When the torn pages guide the way</strong><br><strong>Will you be willing to join me</strong><br><strong>To play once again the chords from our dreams?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/5c6c1078f2184888e86232cc995520cd.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a quiet rainy night, a girl named <strong>Xishi Yin</strong> mysteriously disappears after stepping into a forbidden mountain area while searching for the legendary &quot;Miracle Grass.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy named <strong>Qiu Yixuan</strong> follows memories and clues, venturing deep into a trap-laden cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bodies, monsters, lies, and old warmth intertwine, as the truth gradually emerges from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/fbe2847edf55d6c502133f5b962e0dbc.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains rich story branches and multiple endings,<br>taking you through the cracks between fairy tales and reality, witnessing a final fate woven from hope and loss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/fcd6bf3d53946ed2dc0a2e3be87b2cd1.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/db7a9f46924ad267c9c97f86100777c0.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touching and delicate narrative experience</strong><br>Continuing the world of <i>Wings’ Wish</i>, it tells the intertwined fate of the girl and boy, deeply moving players’ hearts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delicately eerie atmosphere</strong><br>The game creates an environment that is both chilling and thought-provoking, with unknown fears lurking in every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative and intricate puzzle mechanisms</strong><br>Puzzles and clues are tightly connected, cleverly designed to fit the story, with moderate difficulty emphasizing guidance and reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exquisite and detailed visuals</strong><br>The artwork is beautiful and refined, with key scenes accompanied by delicate CG to enhance immersion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/b4adb91085013bd359fa93150ef8b35d.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Horror Puzzle<br><strong>Number of Endings:</strong> 4 (*plus some hidden endings)<br><strong>Estimated Completion Time:</strong> 3 to 5 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br>Movement: Arrow keys<br>Investigate/Confirm: Z / Space / Enter<br>Menu/Cancel: X / ESC<br>Save Management: F5<br>Run: Shift</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/d482d2ad000ba86eec93c1a3965cc6bb.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Creator: 秋之忧郁</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Artist: 雨兮</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promotional Artwork: 星羽樱</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: Eternal Dream Studio</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more staff, please see the in-game credits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/2ede77ab68b6008fc08f3d7931967a78.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are welcome to stream gameplay and create fan works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are of moderate difficulty; try to avoid spoilers and walkthroughs as much as possible~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The script, character designs, illustrations, and CG art in this game are all original works. Please do not unpack or redistribute without permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions, feel free to contact the creator. We will try to respond promptly and resolve any issues encountered in the game.<br>Feedback Email: <a href=\"mailto:413228337@qq.com\">413228337@qq.com</a></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, we wish you a pleasant gaming experience~!!!</p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/b96cc742e2758fc888fa6b9dfd43a26a.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When all darkness fades away</strong><br><strong>When the torn pages guide the way</strong><br><strong>Will you be willing to join me</strong><br><strong>To play once again the chords from our dreams?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/5c6c1078f2184888e86232cc995520cd.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a quiet rainy night, a girl named <strong>Xishi Yin</strong> mysteriously disappears after stepping into a forbidden mountain area while searching for the legendary &quot;Miracle Grass.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy named <strong>Qiu Yixuan</strong> follows memories and clues, venturing deep into a trap-laden cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bodies, monsters, lies, and old warmth intertwine, as the truth gradually emerges from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/fbe2847edf55d6c502133f5b962e0dbc.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains rich story branches and multiple endings,<br>taking you through the cracks between fairy tales and reality, witnessing a final fate woven from hope and loss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/fcd6bf3d53946ed2dc0a2e3be87b2cd1.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/db7a9f46924ad267c9c97f86100777c0.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touching and delicate narrative experience</strong><br>Continuing the world of <i>Wings’ Wish</i>, it tells the intertwined fate of the girl and boy, deeply moving players’ hearts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delicately eerie atmosphere</strong><br>The game creates an environment that is both chilling and thought-provoking, with unknown fears lurking in every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative and intricate puzzle mechanisms</strong><br>Puzzles and clues are tightly connected, cleverly designed to fit the story, with moderate difficulty emphasizing guidance and reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exquisite and detailed visuals</strong><br>The artwork is beautiful and refined, with key scenes accompanied by delicate CG to enhance immersion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/b4adb91085013bd359fa93150ef8b35d.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Horror Puzzle<br><strong>Number of Endings:</strong> 4 (*plus some hidden endings)<br><strong>Estimated Completion Time:</strong> 3 to 5 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong><br>Movement: Arrow keys<br>Investigate/Confirm: Z / Space / Enter<br>Menu/Cancel: X / ESC<br>Save Management: F5<br>Run: Shift</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/d482d2ad000ba86eec93c1a3965cc6bb.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Creator: 秋之忧郁</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Artist: 雨兮</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promotional Artwork: 星羽樱</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: Eternal Dream Studio</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more staff, please see the in-game credits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264350/extras/2ede77ab68b6008fc08f3d7931967a78.avif?t=1755316168\" width=610 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are welcome to stream gameplay and create fan works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are of moderate difficulty; try to avoid spoilers and walkthroughs as much as possible~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The script, character designs, illustrations, and CG art in this game are all original works. Please do not unpack or redistribute without permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions, feel free to contact the creator. We will try to respond promptly and resolve any issues encountered in the game.<br>Feedback Email: <a href=\"mailto:413228337@qq.com\">413228337@qq.com</a></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, we wish you a pleasant gaming experience~!!!</p></li></ul>",
      "short_description": "On a rainy night, Xiaoyin disappears searching for the legendary “Miracle Grass.” Yixuan follows clues into a trap-filled cave where bodies, monsters, lies, and warmth intertwine. Multiple endings guide you through fairy tale and reality, revealing a fate woven from hope and loss.",
